t forecast and drift report are advisory, not authoritative; the DB backup runs automatically every day and can also be triggered manually by an administrator." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="330" y="820" width="760" height="58" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="nWhy" value="This module gathers the cross-cutting, non-domain capabilities — dashboards, notifications, audit and backup — that every other module depends on but that belong to no single operational module." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;size=14;align=left;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="700" width="240" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>